   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Measurement specialist »phoenix« </h3> <h1> Maximum precision when measuring fine boring tools </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Do you want to set your precision turning tools and reamers accurately to the μm in order to avoid rejects and reduce your tool costs?</strong></p> <p>Then you are ideally equipped with the ZOLLER »phoenix« presetting and measuring machine. With »phoenix«, you can hold your tools between centers and measure all parameters fully automatically using the snap gauge principle, achieving maximum accuracy for the best quality of your workpieces and longer tool life. For maximum efficiency and productivity in your production.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
